    "title": "Jonesboro parks director placed on leave amid Department of Justice investigation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Thomas Farrar ,\n11 hours ago JONESBORO, Ark. (KATV) — Parks Director Danny Kapales is being investigating by the Department of Justice, the City of Jonesboro announced Tuesday. Officials did not say what Kapales was being investigated for. A public affairs officer with the Federal Bureau of Investigation's Little Rock office said the agency was... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
